---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
interface Props {view:string;}
const {view}=Astro.props;
const global=view==='catalogo';
---
<DemoFrame responsive width={1600} height={1000} label={`Eurotech Gestor · ${view}`}>
<div class="gestor-original">
 <aside class="g-sidebar"><div class="g-brand"><div><img src="/images/works/eurotech/logo.svg" alt="Eurotech Germany"/><span>Gestor</span></div><h5>{global?'Global':'Uruguay'}</h5><p>{global?'Gestión consolidada de Argentina y Uruguay':'Gestión interna por tienda'}</p></div><div class="g-country"><span>VISTA ACTIVA</span><div><b class:list={{active:global}}>◎ Global</b><b class:list={{active:!global}}>🇺🇾 UY</b><b>🇦🇷 AR</b></div></div><nav>{(global?['Dashboard global','Productos globales','Grupos globales','Usuarios','Documentación']:['Dashboard','Productos','Grupos de productos','Eventos','Categorías','Etiquetas','Configuración']).map(label=><span>{label}</span>)}{!global&&<div class="g-subnav"><b class:list={{selected:view==='sync'}}>Sync</b><span>Agentes</span><span>Fuentes</span></div>}</nav>{!global&&<div class="g-docs">Documentación</div>}<div class="g-session"><b>Super Admin</b><span>Rol: Super-admin</span><div>Cerrar sesión</div></div></aside>
 <div class="g-content">
 {view==='catalogo'&&<><div class="g-page-heading"><p class="g-eyebrow">◎ &nbsp; CATÁLOGO CONSOLIDADO</p><h5>Productos globales</h5><p>Una ficha por producto para organizar, clasificar y operar Argentina y Uruguay sin mezclar sus datos comerciales.</p></div><div class="g-metrics">{[['PRODUCTOS GLOBALES','1288'],['VINCULADOS AR + UY','829'],['SÓLO ARGENTINA','25'],['SÓLO URUGUAY','434'],['PUBLICADOS','1882']].map(([label,value])=><div><span>{label}</span><b>{value}</b></div>)}</div><div class="g-search g-box"><div><label>Buscar por nombre<input placeholder="Nombre en cualquier país"/></label><label>Buscar por SKU<input placeholder="SKU Argentina o Uruguay"/></label><button>Buscar</button></div><details><summary>☷ &nbsp; Más filtros <span>⌄</span></summary><div class="g-extra-filters"><label>Estado<select><option>Todos los estados</option><option>Publicado</option></select></label><label>Tienda<select><option>Argentina y Uruguay</option><option>Uruguay</option></select></label></div></details></div><div class="g-bulk g-box"><header><span class="g-layer">▱</span><div><b>Acciones masivas globales</b><p>Actúan sobre las versiones AR/UY de cada ficha, respetando cada tienda.</p></div><div class="g-tabs"><b>Seleccionados (0)</b><span>Resultados (1288)</span></div></header><div class="g-bulk-options"><label>Estado / publicación<select><option>No cambiar</option></select></label><label>Categoría<div><select><option>Agregar</option></select><select><option>No cambiar</option></select></div></label><label>Grupo global<div><select><option>Asignar</option></select><select><option>No cambiar</option></select></div></label></div><footer><button>☑ Aplicar a 0 fichas</button></footer></div><div class="g-table g-box"><div class="g-table-head"><span>□</span><span>Producto</span><span>Argentina</span><span>Uruguay</span><span>Sincronización</span><span>Acciones</span></div>{[['Accesorios compresor de aire - 18 pcs. - acoples pico mide infla','0001','24.669,00','794,30'],['Acople rápido para compresor - 5 pcs.','0005','7.579,00','210,60']].map(([name,sku,ar,uy])=><div class="g-table-row"><span>□</span><div><b>{name}</b><small>Vinculado en ambos países</small></div><div><code>{sku}</code><em>PUBLICADO</em><small>${ar} ARS</small></div><div><code>{sku}</code><em>PUBLICADO</em><small>${uy} UYU</small></div><div class="g-synced"><span>🇦🇷 <i>Sincronizado</i></span><span>🇺🇾 <i>Sincronizado</i></span></div><div><button>Abrir ficha global</button><span class="g-more">Más acciones</span></div></div>)}</div></>}
 {view==='producto'&&<><div class="g-product-toolbar"><span>← &nbsp;Volver a productos</span><div><span>Guardar borrador</span><span>Pausar</span><span>Archivar</span></div></div><div class="g-editor"><div><div class="g-box g-product-title"><span class="g-eyebrow">PRODUCTO</span><h5>Detector fuga y medidor presión Radiador - 18 pcs.</h5><div class="g-product-id"><span>SKU 5054</span><em>PUBLICADO</em></div><div class="g-edit-outline">Editar título y contenido &nbsp;↗</div><div class="g-source-links"><span>Ver publicación fuente ML ↗</span><span>Ver WooCommerce ↗</span></div></div><div class="g-box g-prices"><h6>Precios</h6><p>Precios de venta del producto en esta tienda.</p><div>{[['Precio regular','4.665,00 UYU'],['Precio de oferta','4.665,00 UYU'],['Precio contado','4.385,00 UYU'],['Precio mayorista','Consultar']].map(([label,value])=><section><span>{label}</span><strong>{value}</strong></section>)}</div></div><div class="g-box g-classification"><h6>Clasificación</h6><p>Categorías, etiquetas y grupos del producto.</p><div><span>CATEGORÍAS</span><b>Medición y prueba</b></div><div><span>ETIQUETAS</span><b>Ofertas</b></div><div class="g-edit-outline">Editar clasificación</div></div></div><aside class="g-box g-gallery"><div><h6>Imágenes</h6><span>Editar galería ↗</span></div><img src="/images/works/eurotech/detector.jpg" alt="Detector de fugas de radiador Eurotech"/><div class="g-thumbs">{['detector.jpg','detector-2.jpg','detector-3.jpg'].map((img,i)=><button data-g-photo={img} aria-label={`Ver fotografía ${i+1}`} aria-pressed={i===0}><img src={`/images/works/eurotech/${img}`} alt=""/></button>)}</div></aside></div></>}
 {view==='sync'&&<><div class="g-page-heading"><h5>Historial de sincronización</h5><p>Revisa eventos de productos, imágenes, metadata y taxonomías limitados a Eurotech Uruguay.</p></div><div class="g-sync g-box"><h6>Carga inicial WooCommerce</h6><p>Carga el catálogo inicial desde WooCommerce una sola vez por tienda. Los SKUs con patrón -AC o -ACNN se reconocen como repeated SKU y conservan tanto el SKU real/original como el alias de WooCommerce.</p><button disabled>Bootstrap WooCommerce UY</button><small>Bootstrap completado</small></div><div class="g-sync g-box"><h6>Actualizar imágenes y categorías WooCommerce</h6><p>Vuelve a consultar el catálogo actual de WooCommerce por SKU, corrige URLs e IDs de imágenes y actualiza categorías sin recrear productos. Las imágenes cargadas manualmente se conservan.</p><button>Reparar WooCommerce UY</button></div><div class="g-sync g-box"><h6>Importaciones manuales</h6><p>Ejecuta fuentes continuas y revisa el resultado por conteos operativos.</p><button>Importar Aleph UY</button><button>Importar Mercado Libre UY</button></div><div class="g-aleph g-box"><div><p class="g-eyebrow">CATÁLOGO VIVO</p><h6>Productos desde Aleph Uruguay</h6><p>Consulta todos los artículos de Aleph, aunque todavía no estén publicados en la web, y selecciona cuáles crear como borradores en Gestor.</p></div><button>+ Explorar catálogo Aleph</button></div><div class="g-sync-metrics">{[['Revisión de SKUs','5','Conflictos pendientes'],['Revisión de fuentes','0','Cambios pendientes'],['Revisión de precios Aleph','2','Precios pendientes']].map(([label,n,note])=><div class="g-box"><span>{label}</span><b>{n}</b><p>{note}</p></div>)}</div></>}
 </div>
</div>
</DemoFrame>
<style>
@font-face{font-family:GestorInter;src:url('/images/works/gestor/inter.woff2');font-weight:100 900;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:GestorSpace;src:url('/images/works/gestor/space.woff2');font-weight:300 700;font-display:swap}

.gestor-original{display:grid;grid-template-columns:272px 1fr;width:1600px;height:1000px;background:#fbfaf9;color:#2b211f;font:14px/1.5 GestorInter,Arial,sans-serif;--g-red:#b90b08;--g-border:#dfd8d5}.g-sidebar{height:100%;padding:20px 16px;position:relative;border-right:1px solid var(--g-border);background:linear-gradient(#fff,#faf3f2)}.g-brand{background:#000;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px}.g-brand>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.g-brand img{width:92px;height:35px;object-fit:contain}.g-brand>div>span{border-left:1px solid #aaa;padding-left:10px;color:#bbb;letter-spacing:.075em;font-weight:600}.g-brand h5{font:600 24px/1.25 GestorSpace,GestorInter,sans-serif;margin-top:8px}.g-brand p{font-size:14px;color:#aaa;margin-top:4px}.g-country{border:1px solid var(--g-border);padding:8px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff9;margin:12px 0}.g-country>span{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#827976;margin:0 4px 7px}.g-country>div{display:flex;gap:4px}.g-country b{flex:1;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:7px;padding:8px 6px;text-align:center}.g-country .active{background:var(--g-red);color:white;border-color:var(--g-red);box-shadow:0 3px 7px #b90b0830}.g-sidebar nav{margin-top:10px}.g-sidebar nav>span,.g-docs{display:block;padding:12px;font-size:14px}.g-subnav{display:grid;gap:4px;border-left:1px solid var(--g-border);padding-left:12px}.g-subnav>*{padding:5px 12px;font-weight:400}.g-subnav .selected{color:#b90b08;background:#f4e0df;border-radius:5px}.g-session{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:16px;right:16px;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;background:#fff9}.g-session b,.g-session span{display:block}.g-session span{color:#897d79;margin:4px 0 14px}.g-session>div{text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--g-border);padding:9px;border-radius:7px}.g-content{padding:24px;min-width:0}.g-page-heading{margin-bottom:24px}.g-page-heading h5{font:600 24px/1.3 GestorSpace,GestorInter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:8px 0}.g-page-heading p:not(.g-eyebrow){color:#7b6e6a}.g-eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--g-red);font-weight:600}.g-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}.g-metrics>div,.g-box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #00000005}.g-metrics>div{padding:16px}.g-metrics span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:600;color:#7b6e6a;display:block;white-space:nowrap}.g-metrics b{display:block;font-size:24px;margin-top:8px;font-weight:600}.gestor-original input,.gestor-original select{background:#fcf9f8;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:7px;width:100%;padding:8px 12px;font:14px/1.5 GestorInter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#382b26}.gestor-original input::placeholder{color:#a5a2a4}.gestor-original label{display:block;font-size:14px}.gestor-original label>input,.gestor-original label>select{margin-top:5px}.gestor-original button{padding:9px 16px;font:500 14px/1.5 GestorInter,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:var(--g-red);color:#fff;cursor:pointer}.g-search{padding:16px;margin-bottom:24px}.g-search>div{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:12px}.g-search label{flex:1}.g-search details{margin-top:15px}.g-search summary{background:#faf8f7;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.g-search summary span{float:right}.g-extra-filters{display:flex;gap:20px;padding-top:14px}.g-bulk{margin-bottom:16px}.g-bulk header{padding:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--g-border)}.g-layer{font-size:23px;color:#b90b08}.g-bulk header b{font-size:15px}.g-bulk header p{font-size:12px;color:#81736e;margin:0}.g-tabs{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:7px;padding:3px;margin-left:auto;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.g-tabs b{background:var(--g-red);color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:13px!important}.g-tabs>span{padding-right:8px}.g-bulk-options{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px}.g-bulk-options>label{flex:1}.g-bulk-options label>div{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-top:5px}.g-bulk-options label>div select:first-child{width:95px;flex:none}.g-bulk footer{border-top:1px solid var(--g-border);padding:12px 16px;text-align:right}.g-table{overflow:hidden}.g-table-head,.g-table-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30px 2.8fr .75fr .75fr 1fr 1.05fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px}.g-table-head{background:#faf6f5;font-size:13px}.g-table-row{border-top:1px solid var(--g-border);font-size:13px;min-height:108px}.g-table-row b{font-weight:500}.g-table-row small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#877b77;margin-top:5px}.g-table-row code{font-size:12px;color:#777}.gestor-original em{display:table;background:#e8f7f3;color:#408c7c;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;padding:1px 6px;margin:3px 0}.g-table-row button{font-size:12px;width:100%;padding:7px}.g-more{display:block;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:6px;text-align:center;padding:7px;margin-top:7px}.g-synced>span{display:block;margin:5px 0}.g-synced i{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--g-border);padding:4px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:5px}.g-product-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:14px}.g-product-toolbar>div{display:flex;gap:12px}.g-product-toolbar span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}.g-editor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1fr;gap:24px}.g-product-title,.g-prices,.g-classification{padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px}.g-product-title h5{font:600 30px/1.25 GestorSpace,sans-serif;margin:15px 0}.g-product-id{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#827470}.g-edit-outline{border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;margin:20px 0 10px}.g-source-links{display:flex;gap:16px;color:#9b2520;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}.gestor-original h6{font:600 18px/1.4 GestorSpace,sans-serif}.g-prices>p,.g-classification>p{font-size:13px;color:#877b77;margin-top:5px}.g-prices>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}.g-prices section{border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:8px;padding:15px}.g-prices section>span{font-size:12px;color:#877b77;display:block}.g-prices strong{font-size:20px;margin-top:8px;display:block}.g-classification>div:not(.g-edit-outline){display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}.g-classification>div>span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#877b77}.g-classification b{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--g-border);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 10px}.g-gallery{padding:20px;height:fit-content}.g-gallery>div:first-child{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.g-gallery>div:first-child>span{font-size:12px;color:#9b2520}.g-gallery>img{width:100%;height:380px;object-fit:contain;margin:20px 0}.g-thumbs{display:flex;gap:10px}.g-thumbs button{width:70px;height:70px;background:white!important;padding:4px!important;border:1px solid var(--g-border)}.g-thumbs button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#b90b08}.g-thumbs img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.g-sync{padding:20px;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:8px}.g-sync p,.g-aleph p:not(.g-eyebrow){color:#85746d;margin:7px 0 16px}.g-sync button+button{margin-left:10px}.g-sync button:disabled{opacity:.6}.g-sync small{display:block;color:#887b76;margin-top:4px;font-size:12px}.g-aleph{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:24px;padding:20px;border-left:4px solid #b90b08;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#fbefee,#fff);margin-bottom:24px}.g-aleph>div{flex:1}.g-aleph .g-eyebrow{margin-bottom:5px}.g-aleph p:last-child{max-width:730px;margin-bottom:0}.g-sync-metrics{display:flex;gap:16px}.g-sync-metrics>div{flex:1;padding:20px;border-radius:8px}.g-sync-metrics span,.g-sync-metrics p{color:#887970}.g-sync-metrics b{display:block;font-size:24px;margin:5px 0}

@media(max-width:767px){.gestor-original{width:390px;height:780px;display:block;font-size:12px}.g-sidebar{height:68px;padding:10px 16px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--g-border);background:white;display:flex;align-items:center}.g-brand{padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.g-brand img{width:70px;height:25px}.g-brand>div>span{font-size:10px}.g-brand h5{font-size:15px;margin:0}.g-brand p,.g-country,.g-sidebar nav,.g-docs,.g-session{display:none}.g-sidebar::after{content:'☰';margin-left:auto;font-size:22px}.g-content{padding:16px}.g-page-heading{margin-bottom:16px}.g-page-heading h5{font-size:24px}.g-page-heading p:not(.g-eyebrow){font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.g-eyebrow{font-size:10px}.g-metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px}.g-metrics>div{padding:12px}.g-metrics>div:last-child{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.g-metrics span{font-size:9px}.g-metrics b{font-size:23px;margin-top:4px}.g-search{padding:12px;margin-bottom:16px}.g-search>div{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.g-search label{flex-basis:100%;font-size:12px}.gestor-original input,.gestor-original select{font-size:12px}.g-search button{width:100%}.g-search summary{font-size:11px}.g-bulk header{padding:12px;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.g-bulk header b{font-size:12px}.g-bulk header p{font-size:10px}.g-tabs{margin:8px 0 0}.g-bulk-options,.g-bulk footer,.g-table{display:none}.g-editor{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}.g-product-toolbar{font-size:10px;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}.g-product-toolbar span{padding:5px 8px}.g-product-toolbar>div{gap:6px}.g-product-title,.g-prices,.g-classification{padding:16px;margin-bottom:15px}.g-product-title h5{font-size:25px}.g-product-id{font-size:11px}.g-source-links{font-size:10px;gap:10px}.g-gallery{display:none}.g-prices section{padding:10px}.g-prices strong{font-size:18px}.g-prices section>span{font-size:10px}.g-sync{padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px}.g-sync h6{font-size:16px}.g-sync p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px}.g-sync button{font-size:11px;padding:8px 10px}.g-sync button+button{margin-left:4px}.g-sync small{font-size:10px}.g-aleph{padding:14px;display:block}.g-aleph h6{font-size:16px}.g-aleph p:not(.g-eyebrow){font-size:11px}.g-aleph button{font-size:11px;margin-top:12px}.g-sync-metrics{display:none}}
</style>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.gestor-original').forEach(demo=>{demo.addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=(event.target as Element).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-g-photo]');if(!button)return;const photo=demo.querySelector<HTMLImageElement>('.g-gallery>img');if(photo)photo.src=`/images/works/eurotech/${button.dataset.gPhoto}`;demo.querySelectorAll('[data-g-photo]').forEach(el=>el.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(el===button)));});});
</script>
